{"alph1":{"id":"alph1","prompt":"Quot litterae sunt in alphabeto Latino classico?","options":["21","23","26"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"23 litterae: A B C D E F G H I K L M N O P Q R S T V X Y Z — sine J et W.","exerciseType":"multiple-choice","exerciseId":"i-alph-mc","exerciseTitle":"Alphabetum Latinum Classicum","exerciseInstructions":"Elige responsum rectum pro quaque quaestione.","lessonId":"i-alphabetum-et-soni","lessonTitle":"Alphabetum et Soni","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/alphabetum-et-soni.html"},"alph2":{"id":"alph2","prompt":"Quae binae litterae desunt in alphabeto Latino classico quas hodie in alphabeto Anglico habemus?","options":["J et W","Q et X","A et E"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"J et W litterae medii aevi/Renascentiae sunt, non antiquae Romanae.","exerciseType":"multiple-choice","exerciseId":"i-alph-mc","exerciseTitle":"Alphabetum Latinum Classicum","exerciseInstructions":"Elige responsum rectum pro quaque quaestione.","lessonId":"i-alphabetum-et-soni","lessonTitle":"Alphabetum et Soni","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/alphabetum-et-soni.html"},"alph3":{"id":"alph3","prompt":"Littera 'V' in verbo 'vīnum' quem sonum habet in pronuntiatione restituta?","options":["sonum Anglicum 'v' (ut in 'van')","sonum Anglicum 'w' (ut in 'wine')","sonum Anglicum 'f'"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"V consonans classica sonat ut Anglicum 'w', non 'v'.","exerciseType":"multiple-choice","exerciseId":"i-alph-mc","exerciseTitle":"Alphabetum Latinum Classicum","exerciseInstructions":"Elige responsum rectum pro quaque quaestione.","lessonId":"i-alphabetum-et-soni","lessonTitle":"Alphabetum et Soni","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/alphabetum-et-soni.html"},"alph4":{"id":"alph4","prompt":"Littera 'I' initialis in verbo 'iam' quem sonum habet?","options":["vocalem brevem, ut in 'bit'","consonantem, ut Anglicum 'y' in 'yes'","sonum 'j' Francogallicum, ut in 'jour'"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"Ante vocalem, I initiale saepe con