it an falsa.","lessonId":"i-syllabae-et-accentus","lessonTitle":"Syllabae et Accentus","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/syllabae-et-accentus.html"},"syll7":{"id":"syll7","statement":"In verbo 'philosophia' (5 syllabae), accentus cadit in paenultima syllaba.","answer":false,"explanation":"Paenultima 'phi' brevis est; accentus recedit ad antepaenultimam: phi-lo-SO-phi-a.","exerciseType":"true-false","exerciseId":"i-syll-tf","exerciseTitle":"Verum an Falsum: Syllabae et Accentus","exerciseInstructions":"Dic utrum quaeque sententia vera sit an falsa.","lessonId":"i-syllabae-et-accentus","lessonTitle":"Syllabae et Accentus","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/syllabae-et-accentus.html"},"syll8":{"id":"syll8","statement":"Combinatio 'muta cum liquida' (ut 'tr' in 'patris') plerumque manet cum syllaba sequenti, non praecedenti.","answer":true,"explanation":"Haec est exceptio classica ad regulam generalem divisionis duarum consonantium.","exerciseType":"true-false","exerciseId":"i-syll-tf","exerciseTitle":"Verum an Falsum: Syllabae et Accentus","exerciseInstructions":"Dic utrum quaeque sententia vera sit an falsa.","lessonId":"i-syllabae-et-accentus","lessonTitle":"Syllabae et Accentus","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/syllabae-et-accentus.html"},"syll9":{"id":"syll9","statement":"In verbis Latinis polysyllabis, accentus umquam cadit in ultima syllaba.","answer":false,"explanation":"Regula sine exceptione: accentus numquam in ultima syllaba verbi Latini polysyllabi.","exerciseType":"true-false","exerciseId":"i-syll-tf","exerciseTitle":"Verum an Falsum: Syllabae et Accentus","exerciseInstructions":"Dic utrum quaeque sententia vera sit an falsa.","lessonId":"i-syllabae-et-accentus","lessonTitle":"Syllabae et Accentus","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/syllabae-et-accentus.html"},"syll10":{"id":"syll10","statement":"Syllaba clausa consonante (ut 'gis' in 'magister') semper gravis est, etiam si vocalem brevem habeat.","answer":true,"explanation":"Clausura consonante sola sufficit ad gravitatem, sine respectu quantitatis vocalis.","exerciseType":"true-false","exerciseId":"i-syll-tf","exerciseTitle":"Verum an Falsum: Syllabae et Accentus","exerciseInstructions":"Dic utrum quaeque sententia vera sit an falsa.","lessonId":"i-syllabae-et-accentus","lessonTitle":"Syllabae et Accentus","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/syllabae-et-accentus.html"},"syll11":{"id":"syll11","pairs":[{"left":"amīcus","right":"a-MĪ-cus (paenultima longa vocali)"},{"left":"magister","right":"ma-GIS-ter (paenultima clausa consonante)"},{"left":"dominus","right":"DO-mi-nus (paenultima brevis et aperta)"},{"left":"patris","right":"PA-tris (disyllabum, muta cum liquida)"},{"left":"philosophia","right":"phi-lo-SO-phi-a (paenultima brevis, 5 syllabae)"}],"explanation":"Quisque exemplum demonstrat unam ex regulis legis paenultimae.","exerciseType":"matching","exerciseId":"i-syll-match","exerciseTitle":"Iunge Verbum cum Accentu Recto","exerciseInstructions":"Iunge quodque verbum cum sua divisione syllabarum et accentu recto.","lessonId":"i-syllabae-et-accentus","lessonTitle":"Syllabae et Accentus","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/syllabae-et-accentus.html"},"vd1":{"id":"vd1","prompt":"Quot diphthongi principales (frequentes) sunt in Latinitate Classica?","options":["duo tantum: ae, oe","quattuor: ae, oe, au, eu","sex, aequaliter frequentes"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"ae, oe, au, eu sunt frequentes; ei et ui rarissimi.","exerciseType":"multiple-choice","exerciseId":"i-vd-mc","exerciseTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","exerciseInstructions":"Elige responsum rectum.","lessonId":"i-vocales-et-diphthongi","lessonTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/vocales-et-diphthongi.html"},"vd2":{"id":"vd2","prompt":"Verbum 'aurum' incipit sono simili Anglico:","options":["'ow' in 'how'","'oo' in 'moon'","'or' in 'for'"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"'au' sonat /au̯/, ut Anglicum 'ow'.","exerciseType":"multiple-choice","exerciseId":"i-vd-mc","exerciseTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","exerciseInstructions":"Elige responsum rectum.","lessonId":"i-vocales-et-diphthongi","lessonTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/vocales-et-diphthongi.html"},"vd3":{"id":"vd3","prompt":"In verbo 'aër' (e Graeco, 'air'), litterae 'ae' sunt:","options":["diphthongus normalis","duae vocales separatae (hiatus)","littera muta, non pronuntiata"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"Diaeresis (ë) monstrat hiatum: a-ër, duae syllabae.","exerciseType":"multiple-choice","exerciseId":"i-vd-mc","exerciseTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","exerciseInstructions":"Elige responsum rectum.","lessonId":"i-vocales-et-diphthongi","lessonTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/vocales-et-diphthongi.html"},"vd4":{"id":"vd4","prompt":"Vocalis longa (ā) generaliter tenetur ___ quam vocalis brevis (a).","options":["fere duplo longius temporis","eodem tempore, sola qualitate differt","dimidio brevius"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"Longitudo, non qualitas, distinguit vocales longas a brevibus in Latinitate Classica.","exerciseType":"multiple-choice","exerciseId":"i-vd-mc","exerciseTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","exerciseInstructions":"Elige responsum rectum.","lessonId":"i-vocales-et-diphthongi","lessonTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/vocales-et-diphthongi.html"},"vd5":{"id":"vd5","prompt":"Quod par verborum demonstrat differentiam solius quantitatis vocalis?","options":["rosa / rosam","ōs, ōris / os, ossis ('mouth' / 'bone')","canis / felis"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"Eadem litterae, sola longitudo prima vocalis distinguit 'os' (mouth) ab 'os' (bone).","exerciseType":"multiple-choice","exerciseId":"i-vd-mc","exerciseTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","exerciseInstructions":"Elige responsum rectum.","lessonId":"i-vocales-et-diphthongi","lessonTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/vocales-et-diphthongi.html"},"vd6":{"id":"vd6","prompt":"In 'mālum' (pomum, 'apple'), vocalis 'ā' est ___.","options":["longa","brevis"],"answers":["longa"],"explanation":"Macron monstrat longitudinem: mālum = apple.","exerciseType":"fill-blank","exerciseId":"i-vd-fill","exerciseTitle":"Longa an Brevis?","exerciseInstructions":"Elige 'longa' vel 'brevis' pro quaque vocali notata.","lessonId":"i-vocales-et-diphthongi","lessonTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/vocales-et-diphthongi.html"},"vd7":{"id":"vd7","prompt":"In 'malum' (calamitas, 'evil'), vocalis 'a' est ___.","options":["longa","brevis"],"answers":["brevis"],"explanation":"Sine macrone, vocalis brevis est: malum = evil, misfortune.","exerciseType":"fill-blank","exerciseId":"i-vd-fill","exerciseTitle":"Longa an Brevis?","exerciseInstructions":"Elige 'longa' vel 'brevis' pro quaque vocali notata.","lessonId":"i-vocales-et-diphthongi","lessonTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/vocales-et-diphthongi.html"},"vd8":{"id":"vd8","prompt":"In 'ōs, ōris' ('mouth'), prima vocalis est ___.","options":["longa","brevis"],"answers":["longa"],"explanation":"ōs (mouth) habet ō longam.","exerciseType":"fill-blank","exerciseId":"i-vd-fill","exerciseTitle":"Longa an Brevis?","exerciseInstructions":"Elige 'longa' vel 'brevis' pro quaque vocali notata.","lessonId":"i-vocales-et-diphthongi","lessonTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/vocales-et-diphthongi.html"},"vd9":{"id":"vd9","prompt":"In 'os, ossis' ('bone'), prima vocalis est ___.","options":["longa","brevis"],"answers":["brevis"],"explanation":"os (bone) habet o brevem — geminata 'ss' sequens non mutat quantitatem vocalis ipsius.","exerciseType":"fill-blank","exerciseId":"i-vd-fill","exerciseTitle":"Longa an Brevis?","exerciseInstructions":"Elige 'longa' vel 'brevis' pro quaque vocali notata.","lessonId":"i-vocales-et-diphthongi","lessonTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/vocales-et-diphthongi.html"},"vd10":{"id":"vd10","prompt":"In verbo 'poëta' ('poet'), 'oe' NON est diphthongus, sed duae syllabae separatae: hoc dicitur ___.","options":["hiatus","diphthongus"],"answers":["hiatus"],"explanation":"Diaeresis (ë) in editionibus modernis monstrat hiatum, non diphthongum.","exerciseType":"fill-blank","exerciseId":"i-vd-fill","exerciseTitle":"Longa an Brevis?","exerciseInstructions":"Elige 'longa' vel 'brevis' pro quaque vocali notata.","lessonId":"i-vocales-et-diphthongi","lessonTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/vocales-et-diphthongi.html"},"vd11":{"id":"vd11","pairs":[{"left":"ae (ut in 'caelum')","right":"sonat ut Anglicum 'eye' in 'aisle' (/ai̯/)"},{"left":"oe (ut in 'poena')","right":"sonat ut Anglicum 'oi' in 'boy' (/oi̯/)"},{"left":"au (ut in 'aurum')","right":"sonat ut Anglicum 'ow' in 'how' (/au̯/)"},{"left":"eu (ut in 'Eurōpa')","right":"duae vocales coniunctae, rarior, /eu̯/"},{"left":"ui (ut in 'cui')","right":"rarissimus, tantum in paucis verbis ut 'cui', 'huic'"}],"explanation":"Quisque diphthongus unam syllabam efficit, cum sono proprio distincto ab utraque vocali seorsum lecta.","exerciseType":"matching","exerciseId":"i-vd-match","exerciseTitle":"Iunge Diphthongum cum Sono","exerciseInstructions":"Iunge quemque diphthongum cum descriptione recta soni eius.","lessonId":"i-vocales-et-diphthongi","lessonTitle":"Vocales et Diphthongi","level":"I","lessonUrl":"gradus/fundamenta/vocales-et-diphthongi.html"}}